WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.434
MyWell is built for everyone — from village
farmers tracking their local wells,

2
00:00:05.554 --> 00:00:08.506
to water researchers and administrators.

3
00:00:08.626 --> 00:00:14.314
That is why the app offers two ways to view
the menu: Easy view, and Advanced view.

4
00:00:15.117 --> 00:00:19.053
At the top of the menu, you will find the view
mode toggle.

5
00:00:19.173 --> 00:00:24.165
It lets you switch instantly between Easy view
and Advanced view whenever you like.

6
00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:27.695
Easy view is the streamlined menu.

7
00:00:27.815 --> 00:00:34.271
It is designed for daily field monitoring — your
Home view, recording a reading, your station list,

8
00:00:34.391 --> 00:00:38.015
your measurements, the weather, and your
station map.

9
00:00:38.135 --> 00:00:43.055
Everything you need to do your daily work is
right here without unnecessary clutter.

10
00:00:43.883 --> 00:00:48.587
When you want deeper insights or
administrative tools, tap Advanced.

11
00:00:48.707 --> 00:00:53.555
Switching to Advanced never removes your daily
tasks — it keeps them all,

12
00:00:53.675 --> 00:00:56.003
and unlocks the rest of the app.

13
00:00:56.817 --> 00:01:00.561
Advanced view opens up the community MARVI
dataset.

14
00:01:00.681 --> 00:01:06.609
You can explore stations on the map, follow long-term
groundwater trends across different seasons,

15
00:01:06.729 --> 00:01:09.225
and review summary statistics.

16
00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:15.882
You also get the Advanced trend chart builder,
allowing you to plot multiple stations together,

17
00:01:16.002 --> 00:01:21.090
compare water levels against rainfall, and
save custom views for reporting.

18
00:01:21.917 --> 00:01:27.989
You can choose whether MyWell always opens in Easy
or Advanced view in Settings under Display.

19
00:01:28.109 --> 00:01:33.653
Your choice is saved, so the app always opens
in the mode that suits your workflow best.

20
00:01:34.483 --> 00:01:36.427
That is the whole page.

21
00:01:36.547 --> 00:01:41.203
You can replay this tutorial any time from the
Learning page inside the app.

22
00:01:41.323 --> 00:01:43.987
Thanks for helping look after our water.
